#: scenario2:scenario2_1E6C256C_B493_478B_9873_8BF3B45AB41F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ab1da3406d6e33bf95e832a3f4fea253ca74f8890857149206c4957523e5c856
#. default-sha256: 69d96d108bc650a5480559c8812f3e5d306b175fc927e83096f4b47658cb1900
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_1E6C256C_B493_478B_9873_8BF3B45AB41F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Without exception, everyone who had wandered into the mansion "
"had lost their lives before the sun rose the next morning."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫\t\t\t\t⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫このお屋敷に迷い込んだ者は、⟪k:7⟫ことごとく、⟪k:8⟫夜明"
"けを待たずしてその命を散らしていきました。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_C93420F3_8FFA_40B7_B856_1FE1F8A0466F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4ab30b08b359c30776126eefac7dd5d259d789ec8c336d28d416167351cdb565
#. default-sha256: 5738012e3977827baf71cbcc3000cbd02e192dc9d42497be102e3ccc48cbcbd2
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_C93420F3_8FFA_40B7_B856_1FE1F8A0466F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫She was the first visitor who had not met this fate."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫ですから、⟪k:1⟫彼女は初めての例外になったのです。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_CAC6C91A_DD29_4811_9238_F2717385F7F9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 32bc3819e9a3bcac5767d6fcf9c2848d8f04590611f82b6ae090d088d628811d
#. default-sha256: 28c19bb72693cb979ac46b8f8d4f0802cb8984b35bd50cd8cd7f443f93767b52
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_CAC6C91A_DD29_4811_9238_F2717385F7F9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Over time, Bestia’s madness gradually subsided; ⟪k:1⟫he even began to seem rather tame. ⟪k:2⟫"
"You would hardly believe it was the same beast who had once reveled in those perverse festivities."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫ベステアの狂気は徐々になりを潜め、⟪k:1⟫逆にしおらしいまでになりました。⟪k:2⟫あんなにも歪んだ"
"饗宴に歓喜していた獣とは思えないほどに。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_1D47DDF0_66D0_43BB_9984_D2296BE1DCDC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 66ec57cafe189f75a90feb9827a4ee99fe518932141e401c076e2752a66900bc
#. default-sha256: 96e75ae7aa53b1b9b52ef2d1a1d2c3e94abbaa0eb2e7d017e87472129198cfec
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_1D47DDF0_66D0_43BB_9984_D2296BE1DCDC"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫He was, I imagine, at a loss for how to behave."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫獣も、⟪k:1⟫どうしていいのか分からなかったのかもしれませんね。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_1FE82314_7A96_4ED8_9B20_9E78C3AB7AA3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 01bbee9f2347a03ec090dcb005f7d8a8b3111f96fcde277ce91c0907bcbd1e0f
#. default-sha256: 59209c5de6982d8aa8ec4799da34c9f1da411a4c0b39675e4f16f8367c862e87
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_1FE82314_7A96_4ED8_9B20_9E78C3AB7AA3"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I too would be flustered in the constant presence of such beauty."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫わたくしだって、⟪k:1⟫彼女のように美しい人が傍にいたら、⟪k:2⟫動揺してしまいますもの。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_E0F46256_924E_4B46_9D3D_844EE9C51BC8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7b926497890b1986a833b4fc255d0ec70c7c6bcb1f8283a019c60fcc38c5da3e
#. default-sha256: f782f22c963cca5bdfbb0f322fe4f6c9d4c2a7ba22f487f0ebf9949f78da922f
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_E0F46256_924E_4B46_9D3D_844EE9C51BC8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But it was not just her appearance; ⟪k:1⟫she had said she wished to live with him—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫"
"a beast who had committed countless atrocities. ⟪k:4⟫Perplexing indeed."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫美しいだけでなく……、⟪k:1⟫忌まわしい行為を繰り広げた自分と暮らしたいだなんて。⟪k:2⟫おかしな話"
"でしょう？ "

#: scenario2:scenario2_B50B9D3C_4359_45FB_A6A0_304B59FEF526
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3be2a6e5929b37bd007211f29fbba43a6f138ebee0147567964573ba5cb98ae3
#. default-sha256: 6d164733681d6569830de7d2bfd96dc2125c878ccc12022412001c21ddee8f58
